    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Horrors of the Pit of Fears</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a little boy with a blue scarf who has been lured into the Pit of Fears and now must survive, explore and unravel the mysteries of the Pit while fighting for his own life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face huge and bizarre monsters;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel all the mysteries of the Pit;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from creatures and predators;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide from monsters;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a way out(or not);</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teles Game Studios Team</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one teenager developer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659880/extras/ed43d38893fe2e078104af2a3f6e8a71.avif?t=1749506691\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659880/extras/de8ae73843177da28ac9f0338d0514d3.avif?t=1749506691\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
